---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../styles/services.css';
import '../styles/home.css';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={"Services & Work | Cody's Auto Detailing | Hanover to Port Elgin"}
  description={"Interior, exterior, full detail, paint correction and ceramic coating. See real work from Cody's Auto Detailing."}
  transparentHeader={true}
>
  
  <main id="main">
   <section class="page-hero" aria-label="Services hero"> <div class="page-hero__media"> <video src="/videos/hero-detail-01.mp4" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="auto" poster="/images/work/hero-detail-01.jpg" aria-hidden="true"></video> <div class="page-hero__veil"></div> </div> <div class="container page-hero__inner"> <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--on-dark">Services &amp; Work</span> <h2 class="page-hero__title">Every Service.<br><span class="page-hero__accent">Every Detail.</span></h2> <p class="page-hero__lead">Five services, one obsession. Pick what fits or book a Full Detail for the complete reset. Scroll down for real work from real customers.</p> <a href="#book" class="btn btn--accent btn--large">Book Now <span class="btn__arrow">&rarr;</span></a> </div> </section>  <section class="section svc"> <div class="container"> <div class="section-head" data-reveal> <span class="eyebrow">The Services</span> <h2>Pick Your Detail.</h2> </div> <div class="svc__list"> <article class="svc-row" data-reveal> <div class="svc-row__media"> <img src="/images/work/work-04.jpg" alt="Interior Detailing" loading="lazy" width="900" height="700"> <span class="svc-row__num">01</span> </div> <div class="svc-row__body"> <h3 class="svc-row__title">Interior Detailing</h3> <p class="svc-row__desc">We pull the interior apart. Vacuum every crevice, steam clean carpets and floor mats, shampoo upholstery, deep clean leather and condition it, dust and dress every plastic surface, polish glass inside and out. The car smells new again.</p> <ul class="svc-row__list"> <li> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> <span>Full vacuum, including under seats and trunk</span> </li><li> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> <span>Steam and shampoo carpets and floor mats</span> </li><li> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> <span>Leather clean and condition</span> </li><li> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> <span>Dash, console, doors, vents detailed</span> </li><li> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> <span>Streak free interior glass</span> </li><li> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> <span>Light pet hair removal</span> </li> </ul> <a href="#book" class="btn btn--dark">Book Interior Detailing <span class="btn__arrow">&rarr;</span></a> </div> </article><article class="svc-row svc-row--flip" data-reveal> <div class="svc-row__media"> <img src="/images/work/hero-detail-03.jpg" alt="Exterior Detailing" loading="lazy" width="900" height="700"> <span class="svc-row__num">02</span> </div> <div class="svc-row__body"> <h3 class="svc-row__title">Exterior Detailing</h3> <p class="svc-row__desc">Two bucket hand wash to lift dirt without damage. Iron and tar decontamination so the clear coat is glass smooth. Wheels and tires get the same care as the paint. Finished with a long lasting spray sealant for weeks of protection.</p> <ul class="svc-row__list"> <li> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> <span>Foam pre wash and contact two bucket wash</span> </li><li> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> <span>Iron and tar decontamination</span> </li><li> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> <span>Clay treatment for a smooth finish</span> </li><li> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> <span>Wheels, tires, wheel wells and trim</span> </li><li> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> <span>Streak free exterior glass</span> </li><li> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> <span>Spray sealant for protection and gloss</span> </li> </ul> <a href="#book" class="btn btn--dark">Book Exterior Detailing <span class="btn__arrow">&rarr;</span></a> </div> </article><article class="svc-row" data-reveal> <div class="svc-row__media"> <img src="/images/work/hero-detail-01.jpg" alt="Full Detail" loading="lazy" width="900" height="700"> <span class="svc-row__num">03</span> </div> <div class="svc-row__body"> <h3 class="svc-row__title">Full Detail</h3> <p class="svc-row__desc">Inside and out. The complete restoration package. We combine the interior and exterior services into one full day on your vehicle. This is the one most customers go with the first time we see their car.</p> <ul class="svc-row__list"> <li> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> <span>Complete interior service</span> </li><li> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> <span>Complete exterior service</span> </li><li> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> <span>Engine bay cleaned and dressed</span> </li><li> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> <span>Trim and rubber restored</span> </li><li> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> <span>Final inspection and walkaround</span> </li><li> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> <span>Optional add ons available</span> </li> </ul> <a href="#book" class="btn btn--dark">Book Full Detail <span class="btn__arrow">&rarr;</span></a> </div> </article><article class="svc-row svc-row--flip" data-reveal> <div class="svc-row__media"> <img src="/images/work/paint-correction.jpg" alt="Paint Correction" loading="lazy" width="900" height="700"> <span class="svc-row__num">04</span> </div> <div class="svc-row__body"> <h3 class="svc-row__title">Paint Correction</h3> <p class="svc-row__desc">Machine polishing that physically removes swirl marks, scratches and oxidation from the clear coat. One stage for newer cars, two or three stage for heavily damaged paint. The depth, gloss and true colour come back.</p> <ul class="svc-row__list"> <li> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> <span>Paint depth and gloss assessment</span> </li><li> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> <span>Decontamination wash before polishing</span> </li><li> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> <span>One to three stage machine polishing</span> </li><li> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> <span>Test panel before full correction</span> </li><li> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> <span>Refined finish, no hologramming</span> </li><li> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> <span>Ready for ceramic coating</span> </li> </ul> <a href="#book" class="btn btn--dark">Book Paint Correction <span class="btn__arrow">&rarr;</span></a> </div> </article><article class="svc-row" data-reveal> <div class="svc-row__media"> <img src="/images/work/ceramic-coating.jpg" alt="Ceramic Coating" loading="lazy" width="900" height="700"> <span class="svc-row__num">05</span> </div> <div class="svc-row__body"> <h3 class="svc-row__title">Ceramic Coating</h3> <p class="svc-row__desc">Long lasting protection applied after the paint is corrected. Hydrophobic, glossy and resistant to UV, road salt, bird droppings and bug etching. Choose from one, three or five year systems based on how long you keep your vehicles.</p> <ul class="svc-row__list"> <li> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> <span>Required paint correction first</span> </li><li> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> <span>Surface prep with panel wipe</span> </li><li> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> <span>Professional grade ceramic application</span> </li><li> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> <span>Curing time monitored</span> </li><li> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> <span>Aftercare instructions provided</span> </li><li> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> <span>One, three or five year options</span> </li> </ul> <a href="#book" class="btn btn--dark">Book Ceramic Coating <span class="btn__arrow">&rarr;</span></a> </div> </article> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="section work-grid"> <div class="container container--wide"> <div class="section-head section-head--center" data-reveal> <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--on-dark">Recent Work</span> <h2>See It Yourself.</h2> <p class="section-head__lead">Hover or tap any clip to watch. Every video is a real vehicle we have detailed. No staged content.</p> </div> <div class="work-grid__items" data-stagger="80"> <figure class="wgrid-card" data-reveal> <video class="wgrid-card__video" src="/videos/work-01.mp4" poster="/images/work/work-01.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" data-hover-play></video> <figcaption class="wgrid-card__cap"> <span>Foam Cannon Wash</span> <span class="wgrid-card__play" aria-hidden="true"> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"></path></svg> </span> </figcaption> </figure><figure class="wgrid-card" data-reveal> <video class="wgrid-card__video" src="/videos/work-02.mp4" poster="/images/work/work-02.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" data-hover-play></video> <figcaption class="wgrid-card__cap"> <span>Interior Reveal</span> <span class="wgrid-card__play" aria-hidden="true"> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"></path></svg> </span> </figcaption> </figure><figure class="wgrid-card" data-reveal> <video class="wgrid-card__video" src="/videos/work-03.mp4" poster="/images/work/work-03.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" data-hover-play></video> <figcaption class="wgrid-card__cap"> <span>Cargo Area Vacuum</span> <span class="wgrid-card__play" aria-hidden="true"> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"></path></svg> </span> </figcaption> </figure><figure class="wgrid-card" data-reveal> <video class="wgrid-card__video" src="/videos/work-04.mp4" poster="/images/work/work-04.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" data-hover-play></video> <figcaption class="wgrid-card__cap"> <span>Dashboard Detail</span> <span class="wgrid-card__play" aria-hidden="true"> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"></path></svg> </span> </figcaption> </figure><figure class="wgrid-card" data-reveal> <video class="wgrid-card__video" src="/videos/work-05.mp4" poster="/images/work/work-05.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" data-hover-play></video> <figcaption class="wgrid-card__cap"> <span>Under Seat Cleanout</span> <span class="wgrid-card__play" aria-hidden="true"> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"></path></svg> </span> </figcaption> </figure><figure class="wgrid-card" data-reveal> <video class="wgrid-card__video" src="/videos/work-06.mp4" poster="/images/work/work-06.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" data-hover-play></video> <figcaption class="wgrid-card__cap"> <span>Mercedes Interior</span> <span class="wgrid-card__play" aria-hidden="true"> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"></path></svg> </span> </figcaption> </figure><figure class="wgrid-card" data-reveal> <video class="wgrid-card__video" src="/videos/work-07.mp4" poster="/images/work/work-07.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" data-hover-play></video> <figcaption class="wgrid-card__cap"> <span>Mobile On Site</span> <span class="wgrid-card__play" aria-hidden="true"> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"></path></svg> </span> </figcaption> </figure><figure class="wgrid-card" data-reveal> <video class="wgrid-card__video" src="/videos/work-08.mp4" poster="/images/work/work-08.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" data-hover-play></video> <figcaption class="wgrid-card__cap"> <span>Rear Seat Detail</span> <span class="wgrid-card__play" aria-hidden="true"> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"></path></svg> </span> </figcaption> </figure><figure class="wgrid-card" data-reveal> <video class="wgrid-card__video" src="/videos/work-09.mp4" poster="/images/work/work-09.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" data-hover-play></video> <figcaption class="wgrid-card__cap"> <span>Seat Restoration</span> <span class="wgrid-card__play" aria-hidden="true"> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"></path></svg> </span> </figcaption> </figure><figure class="wgrid-card" data-reveal> <video class="wgrid-card__video" src="/videos/work-10.mp4" poster="/images/work/work-10.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" data-hover-play></video> <figcaption class="wgrid-card__cap"> <span>Dash and Floor Detail</span> <span class="wgrid-card__play" aria-hidden="true"> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"></path></svg> </span> </figcaption> </figure><figure class="wgrid-card" data-reveal> <video class="wgrid-card__video" src="/videos/work-11.mp4" poster="/images/work/work-11.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" data-hover-play></video> <figcaption class="wgrid-card__cap"> <span>Carpet Deep Clean</span> <span class="wgrid-card__play" aria-hidden="true"> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"></path></svg> </span> </figcaption> </figure><figure class="wgrid-card" data-reveal> <video class="wgrid-card__video" src="/videos/work-12.mp4" poster="/images/work/work-12.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" data-hover-play></video> <figcaption class="wgrid-card__cap"> <span>Half and Half Reveal</span> <span class="wgrid-card__play" aria-hidden="true"> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"></path></svg> </span> </figcaption> </figure> </div> </div> </section>  <section id="book" class="section book-online"> <div class="container container--wide"> <div class="section-head section-head--center" data-reveal> <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--on-dark">Book Online</span> <h2>Pick A Service. Pick A Time. Done.</h2> <p class="section-head__lead">Browse packages, pick what fits your vehicle and lock in a time. Takes about a minute.</p> </div> <div class="book-online__frame-wrap" data-reveal> <iframe src="https://app.urable.com/virtual-shop/s9bYGsQWiT0rCIiMr7aT" title="Book a detail with Cody's Auto Detailing" loading="lazy" scrolling="no" frameborder="0" marginheight="0" marginwidth="0" class="book-online__frame"></iframe> </div> <p class="book-online__fallback" data-reveal>
Prefer to chat first? <a href="tel:+15194771744">Call or text (519) 477-1744</a> or <a href="mailto:codycarter007@icloud.com" class="contact__value">codycarter007@icloud.com</a>.
</p> </div> </section>  
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
